    "description": "family-carpool design tokens. Palette adopted 2026-08 — Airbnb/Uber-simplicity direction, light-mode danger/success/textSecondary adjusted 2026-08 for WCAG AA (4.5:1 body text / 3.0:1 icons, verified against both surface and surfaceRaised). hero* roles added 2026-08 for the Agenda Focus card's deliberately theme-independent dark 'spotlight' surface — see docs/agenda-focus-card-addendum.md 'Hero surface tokens'. rail* roles added 2026-08 for the signed-in web shell's always-dark docked rail (same hex in light and dark; do not reuse hero*). displayFontFamily added 2026-08 (Space Grotesk display + Plus Jakarta Sans body) — web-only; mobile font bundling is separate. Calendar mock spacing 2026-08: page/subtitle type, header 26, mainY 36, mainX 44, railY 28, railX 20. Focus card polish 2026-08 (Calendar light HTML): focusRing 88, focusRingStroke 6, focusRingCoveringGap 10, focusTitle 30/36/700, focusWhen 15/20/600, focusRingLabel 16/20/700, focusRingUnit 9.5/12/600, focusStatusPill 12.5/16/600 (Title Case + leading dot), focusCovering 12.5/16/600, focusAction 13.5/18/700, row statusChip 11/14/700 uppercase. Agenda list chips 2026-08 (Calendar light HTML .filters/.chip, .row-avatars/.av, .row-chevron): filterChip 13.5/18/600, pad 9×16, gap 8, marginBottom 28; listRowAvatar 26, label 10.5/14/700, border 2, overlap 8; listRowTagGap 6, listRowGap 16, listRowChevron 18. Collapsed row pills reuse focusStatusPill. Mocks are the visual source of truth; tokens absorb mock values (see docs/ui-system.md). Token roles are the stable contract; regenerate all platform outputs after any edit here (node design-tokens/generate.mjs)."
